# Markdown docs: scratch notes at the root are ignored by default; everything
# the Sphinx site builds from is explicitly kept, or `docs/` cannot build from
# a fresh clone.
*.md
!README.md
!WORKFLOW.md
!PIPELINE_GUIDE.md
!Plans/*.md
!docs/**/*.md
# Narrative chapters included by docs/guide/*.md
!diccionario_datos.md
!future_project.md
!references.md
!command.md
!GetlocationApiGoogle.md

# Sphinx build output
docs/_build/

